OL,4,CReform selects Robert Jenrick to fight 
OL,5,Cto keep seat                           
OL,6,GMP Robert Jenrick has been reselected  
OL,7,Gas Reform UK's candidate for the       
OL,8,GNewark seat in the next general        
OL,9,Gelection.                              
OL,11,FJenrick had represented the            
OL,12,FNottinghamshire constituency as a      
OL,13,FConservative MP from 2014, before      
OL,14,Fjoining Reform in January this year.   
OL,16,FThere had been recent speculation that 
OL,17,FJenrick would attempt to move to       
OL,18,Fanother seat for the next election,    
OL,19,Falthough he had previously said he     
OL,20,Fintended to stand again in Newark.     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
