OL,3,W"###"###"###T//-,------,/,..--/.,.-,///
OL,4,CI've only sold five copies of GTA 6,   
OL,5,Csays shop owner                        
OL,6,GThe owner of an independent game shop  
OL,7,Gsays he has only sold five copies of   
OL,8,Gthe highly anticipated open-world      
OL,9,Gaction-adventure Grand Theft Auto 6.   
OL,11,FGTA 6, as it is known, is estimated to 
OL,12,Fbecome the biggest entertainment       
OL,13,Flaunch in history following the        
OL,14,Fblockbuster video game's debut on      
OL,15,FThursday, after a 13-year wait.        
OL,17,FBut Richard Tewksbury, who runs Super  
OL,18,FGame Shack in the Silver Arcade in     
OL,19,FLeicester, said he had seen            
OL,20,F"embarrassing" sales of the game       
OL,21,Fbecause it was only released as a      
OL,22,Fdigital download and not on disc. G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
