OL,4,CWoman seriously injured by hit-and-run 
OL,5,Cdriver                                 
OL,6,GA woman has been seriously injured by  
OL,7,Ga hit-and-run driver in Heanor.        
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said a woman in her  
OL,10,F60s suffered a serious, but "not life- 
OL,11,Fthreatening" injury to her leg, when   
OL,12,Fshe was struck by a small dark-        
OL,13,Fcoloured hatchback at the junction of  
OL,14,FHands Road and Brockhall Rise shortly  
OL,15,Fbefore 17:00 GMT on Wednesday.         
OL,17,FThe car was then continued down Hands  
OL,18,FRoad and is believed to have turned    
OL,19,Fonto Lower Clara Mount Road.           
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
