OL,4,CGolf course housing plan submitted to  
OL,5,Ccouncil                                
OL,6,GPlans to build more than 450 homes on  
OL,7,Ga historic golf course in              
OL,8,GNottinghamshire have been formally     
OL,9,Glodged.                                
OL,11,FThe former family-run Beeston Fields   
OL,12,FGolf Club was founded in 1923 but was  
OL,13,Fsold to Cilldara Group in November     
OL,14,F2024.                                  
OL,16,FInitial plans submitted to Broxtowe    
OL,17,FBorough Council in July, which         
OL,18,Fincluded up to 500 homes, a care home  
OL,19,Fand a park, prompted protests that the 
OL,20,Farea was losing its "green lung".      
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
